  remedy=('Capture native model including LPHD1, freeze image/source hash and reviewed baseline; require complete structured output and actual read/event evidence where objective asks chronology. ' if fam=='vm' else 'Keep task unshippable until reviewed physical baseline exists; fail capture on tool errors, collect correct bus/domain and all publishers, manually populate/validate MMS and asset sections, then freeze. Authenticate observation provenance and preserve numeric/boolean bindings. ')
